// grabline.merge.gear.jsonc
//          ^
// this means that this data is merged with other declarations of itself.
// making the original sandbox:grabline under the sandbox pack is merged with this
// making the description of sandbox:grabline "Overwritten description example!"

// NOTE: this depends on the mod load order, however.
// The game automatically builds this through the listed dependencies of your mod, although that wont always be perfect.

{
    "Description": "Overwritten description example!"
}